achieveName0 This Sounds... Familiar
achieveDesc0 Listen to any secret song on the File Select Screen.
achieveName1 Starting Defensively
achieveDesc1 Acquire the Level-1 Shield from Tarin.
achieveName2 Welcome Back Old Friend
achieveDesc2 Acquire the Level-1 Sword from Toronbo Shores.
achieveName3 The Shroomless Raccoon
achieveDesc3 Without ever entering the screen where you acquire the Mushroom, use Magic Powder on the raccoon in the Mysterious Forest.
achieveName4 Super... Link?
achieveDesc4 Find the sleepy mushroom in the Mysterious Forest.
achieveName5 A Witch's Secret
achieveDesc5 Get Magic Powder for the first time.
achieveName6 Chattin' with the Cukeman
achieveDesc6 See all dialogue options available from a transformed Buzz Blob without changing screens.
achieveName7 Nutty Power Freak
achieveDesc7 Pick up either the Guardian Acorn or Piece of Power, then while one is active, pick up the other.
achieveName8 Beyond the Mirage
achieveDesc8 Get the Tail Key.
achieveName9 As Light as a Feather
achieveDesc9 Acquire the Roc's Feather.
achieveName10 Moldorm Mutilator
achieveDesc10 Defeat Moldorm without being harmed.
achieveName11 Tail Cello
achieveDesc11 Acquire the Full Moon Cello from the Tail Cave.
achieveName12 Bombs, You Want Some?
achieveDesc12 Purchase bombs.
achieveName13 Beetles Are the Bomb!
achieveDesc13 In the room left of the entrance inside the Tail Cave, kill the two Hardhat Beetles simultaneously. Leave the field and come back to retry.
achieveName14 Tail Cave Cartographer
achieveDesc14 Enter every room in Tail Cave.
achieveName15 Closing Shop For the Day
achieveDesc15 Get every item from the Trendy Game in one visit and ask the owner for more.
achieveName16 This Pond's All Fished Out
achieveDesc16 Catch every fish in the Fishing Pond in one round, and immediately try to fish anyway without leaving the scene.
achieveName17 Cuccos Gone Wild
achieveDesc17 Provoke a Cucco attack.
achieveName18 Here Stands A Brave Man
achieveDesc18 Agree to be photographed.
achieveName19 Beautiful! I'll Call This 'Game Over'
achieveDesc19 Keep refusing to be photographed.
achieveName20 Chomping The Chain That Binds
achieveDesc20 Rescue Bow-Wow damageless without equipping Roc's Feather or the Shield. Exit and re-enter the area to retry.
achieveName21 Brace Yourself
achieveDesc21 Acquire the Level 1 Power Bracelet.
achieveName22 Genie Grappler
achieveDesc22 Defeat Genie without being harmed.
achieveName23 Bottle Horn
achieveDesc23 Acquire the Conch Horn from the Bottle Grotto.
achieveName24 Bottle Grotto Cartographer
achieveDesc24 Enter every room in Bottle Grotto.
achieveName25 Where the Swamp Flowers Grow
achieveDesc25 Have Bow-Wow eat all 15 enemies in Goponga Swamp without getting harmed. Exit and re-enter the area to retry.
achieveName26 Crazy Tracy's Secret Medicine
achieveDesc26 Purchase some Secret Medicine.
achieveName27 More Powder!
achieveDesc27 Get the Magic Powder capacity upgrade from the Mad Batter.
achieveName28 The Goodest of Metal Doges
achieveDesc28 Have Bow-Wow point out all of the spots where you can dig up Seashells in one session.
achieveName29 That Awful Beast!
achieveDesc29 Have Richard kick you out because you brought Bow-Wow with you.
achieveName30 Kiki vs. Bow-Wow
achieveDesc30 Chase off Kiki the Monkey with Bow-Wow.
achieveName31 Diggy Diggy Hole
achieveDesc31 Purchase a shovel.
achieveName32 Richard's Golden Leaves
achieveDesc32 Collect all 5 Golden Leaves without losing health starting from the underground passage. It is recommended to disable autosave to quickly reload.
achieveName33 A Composer's Secret
achieveDesc33 Trigger Totaka's Song in Richard's house.
achieveName34 More Holes Than Swiss Cheese
achieveDesc34 Get the Slime Key without taking damage. To retry, enter and exit the cave at the start of the Pothole Field interior.
achieveName35 The Talking Timber
achieveDesc35 Talk to a talking tree.
achieveName36 Speedy Linkalez
achieveDesc36 Acquire the Pegasus Boots.
achieveName37 Slime Slasher
achieveDesc37 Defeat Slime Eye without being harmed.
achieveName38 Cavern Bell
achieveDesc38 Acquire the Sea Lily's Bell from the Key Cavern.
achieveName39 Key Cavern Cartographer
achieveDesc39 Enter every room in Key Cavern.
achieveName40 I Have Half A Heart
achieveDesc40 Obtain 7 Heart Containers.
achieveName41 The Giant Ghini and Friends
achieveDesc41 Defeat the four ghosts in the top-right section of the Graveyard.
achieveName42 Hardhit Obliterator
achieveDesc42 Defeat Hardhit Beetle without being harmed.
achieveName43 New Clothes!
achieveDesc43 Acquire the Red Clothes or the Blue Clothes from the Color Dungeon.
achieveName44 Color Dungeon Cartographer
achieveDesc44 Enter every room in the Color Dungeon.
achieveName45 Inception
achieveDesc45 Complete the Dream Shrine by opening both chests in one visit without taking damage.
achieveName46 Date Night - A Walk on the Beach
achieveDesc46 Read Marin's note, find her at the beach, and take her to a scenic cliff in one session. Don't go to the cliff without Marin!
achieveName47 Date Night - All Is Not Well
achieveDesc47 Jump into the Well with Marin.
achieveName48 Date Night - An Afternoon at the Windmill
achieveDesc48 While at the Windmill, dig a hole, play the Ocarina, and get your photo taken with Marin in one session.
achieveName49 Date Night - Gotta Be Strong For Your Woman
achieveDesc49 See all of the different reactions Marin has when you exit a dungeon in one session.
achieveName50 Date Night - Women Love Bad Boys
achieveDesc50 See all dialogue for breaking pots, opening drawers, and hitting cuckoos with Marin in one session.
achieveName51 Date Night - This Girl's a Pro!
achieveDesc51 Watch Marin play the Trendy Game
achieveName52 The Dangerous Yarna Desert
achieveDesc52 Travel through the Yarna Desert and get the Angler Key without taking damage. Exit and re-enter the desert to retry.
achieveName53 Advice From the Dead
achieveDesc53 Talk to some skeletal remains in the Yarna Desert.
achieveName54 Coo Coo Cachoo
achieveDesc54 Have the Walrus resurface with a familiar song after having woken him up.
achieveName55 That Hippo Yelled At Me
achieveDesc55 See all the dialogue of the Hippo in Animal Village without leaving the house.
achieveName56 Swimming Not Required
achieveDesc56 Get the Boss Key in the Angler's Tunnel without having the Flippers.
achieveName57 A License for Swimming
achieveDesc57 Acquire the Flippers.
achieveName58 Angler Annihilator
achieveDesc58 Defeat Angler Fish without being harmed.
achieveName59 Angler's Harp
achieveDesc59 Acquire the Surf Harp from the Angler's Tunnel.
achieveName60 Angler's Tunnel Cartographer
achieveDesc60 Enter every room in Angler's Tunnel.
achieveName61 More Bombs!
achieveDesc61 Get the Bomb capacity upgrade from the Mad Batter.
achieveName62 A Ghostly Escort
achieveDesc62 Take the Ghost to his house and his grave in one session.
achieveName63 Dust to Dust
achieveDesc63 Sprinkle some Magic Powder on the Ghost's grave.
achieveName64 An Expensive Piece of Wood
achieveDesc64 Purchase the Bow.
achieveName65 Am I Not Supposed to Use These?
achieveDesc65 Win the first encounter with Master Stalfos by using Bomb Arrows or Sword Beams and pick up the small key.
achieveName66 Mini-Boss Masher - Master Stalfos
achieveDesc66 Defeat the final three encounters with Master Stalfos in Catfish's Maw without taking damage during and between the fights. Bomb Arrows are NOT allowed.
achieveName67 Mini-Boss Masher - Gohma and the Music Man
achieveDesc67 Defeat both Gohmas without taking damage while using only an Ocarina and damaging with a Bow. You must play the Ocarina at least once.
achieveName68 Hooked on You
achieveDesc68 Acquire the Hookshot.
achieveName69 Eel Eradicator
achieveDesc69 Defeat Slime Eel without being harmed.
achieveName70 Catfish's Marimba
achieveDesc70 Acquire the Wind Marimba from the Catfish's Maw.
achieveName71 Catfish's Maw Cartographer
achieveDesc71 Enter every room in Catfish's Maw.
achieveName72 Inspector Link Is on the Case!
achieveDesc72 Acquire the Magnifying Lens by completing the Trading Sequence.
achieveName73 Washed Up Retriever
achieveDesc73 Acquire the Boomerang.
achieveName74 Money over Troubled Water
achieveDesc74 Collect 100 Rupees in the Raft Game.
achieveName75 Facing the Tiny Face Shrine
achieveDesc75 Obtain the Face Key without taking damage in either the outside or inside sections of the Ancient Ruins.
achieveName76 Now You Know the Truth
achieveDesc76 Discover the truth behind the Island.
achieveName77 Going... Even Further Beyond!
achieveDesc77 Acquire the Level 2 Power Bracelet.
achieveName78 Ballad of the Pol's Voice
achieveDesc78 Defeat the 3 Pol's Voices in the Face Shrine with the Ocarina.
achieveName79 Facade Fighter
achieveDesc79 Defeat Facade without being harmed.
achieveName80 Face Triangle
achieveDesc80 Acquire the Coral Triangle from the Face Shrine.
achieveName81 Face Shrine Cartographer
achieveDesc81 Enter every room in Face Shrine.
achieveName82 Music Man
achieveDesc82 Learn all 3 Ocarina songs.
achieveName83 Pet Sematary
achieveDesc83 Revive the Flying Rooster.
achieveName84 The Keymaster
achieveDesc84 Obtain all 5 Dungeon Keys.
achieveName85 The Chests of Tal Tal Mountain
achieveDesc85 Open all five of the treasure chests located on one screen on Tal Tal Mountain.
achieveName86 The Great Fairies of Koholint Island
achieveDesc86 Heal yourself at all four Great Fairy locations in one session.
achieveName87 The Confusing Owl Statues
achieveDesc87 Talk to every owl statue on the island in one session.
achieveName88 Right Back At Ya!
achieveDesc88 Acquire the Mirror Shield.
achieveName89 Mini-Boss Masher - Grim Creeper
achieveDesc89 Defeat the Grim Creeper in Eagle's Tower damageless.
achieveName90 Eagle Eraser
achieveDesc90 Defeat Evil Eagle without being harmed.
achieveName91 Tower Organ
achieveDesc91 Acquire the Organ of Evening Calm from the Eagle's Tower.
achieveName92 Eagle's Tower Cartographer
achieveDesc92 Enter every room in Eagle's Tower.
achieveName93 More Arrows!
achieveDesc93 Get the Arrow capacity upgrade from the Mad Batter.
achieveName94 You're a Wizzrobe Link!
achieveDesc94 Acquire the Magic Rod.
achieveName95 The Great Dungeon Collector
achieveDesc95 Collect every Map, Compass, and Stone Beak in all nine dungeons.
achieveName96 Teleport Guru
achieveDesc96 Find all four Warp locations.
achieveName97 Hot Head Hustler
achieveDesc97 Defeat Hot Head without being harmed.
achieveName98 Turtle Drum
achieveDesc98 Acquire the Thunder Drum from Turtle Rock.
achieveName99 Turtle Rock Cartographer
achieveDesc99 Enter every room in Turtle Rock.
achieveName100 Awaken My Heart
achieveDesc100 Obtain all 14 Heart Containers.
achieveName101 You Monster!
achieveDesc101 Kill every animal in Mabe Village without leaving the village.
achieveName102 Shell Collection
achieveDesc102 Collect all possible 26 Secret Seashells across Koholint.
achieveName103 By the Power of Seashells!
achieveDesc103 Acquire the Level-2 Sword.
achieveName104 The Travels of THIEF
achieveDesc104 Complete the Photo Album.
achieveName105 Koholint Cartographer
achieveDesc105 Complete the overworld map.
achieveName106 Rupee Hoarder
achieveDesc106 Hold 999 Rupees at once.
achieveName107 Shadow Slayer
achieveDesc107 Defeat all 6 Shadow Nightmares without being harmed.
achieveName108 It Was All A Dream
achieveDesc108 Wake the Wind Fish from his slumber.
achieveName109 A Dream Come True
achieveDesc109 Help Marin fulfill her dream by finishing the adventure without dying once.